WEBVTT

00:00:27.625 --> 00:00:31.601
I just touched down in Vancouver
from Paris a few days ago.

00:00:31.625 --> 00:00:36.018
We took over the Place Vendôme
with the Bronx Brasserie.

00:00:36.042 --> 00:00:38.226
Oui oui, chérie.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:41.934
(Laughter)

00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:44.809
It's wild, because in Paris,
they have this saying,

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:46.309
"le Bronx,"

00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:51.518
which means something
is in disarray or a problem.

00:00:51.542 --> 00:00:53.101
That's the Place Vendôme.

00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:54.559
We shut it down one time.

00:00:54.583 --> 00:00:56.643
(Laughter)

00:00:56.667 --> 00:01:00.559
This lingo came into play
when the Bronx was burning,